SUMMARY:[Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML][Machine Learning] UAI 202
 6 - Paper submission deadline
DESCRIPTION:Conference title: Conference on Uncertainty in Artificial Intel
 ligence\nWebsite: https://www.auai.org/uai2026/\nSource URL: https://www.
 auai.org/uai2026/important_dates\nLocation: Amsterdam\, Netherlands\nTopi
 cs: Probabilistic\, Causal & Uncertainty ML\, Machine Learning\, Learning
  Theory & Statistical Foundations\nSize: L\nSubmission type: Paper-based\
 nConfidence: confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-08-20\nNotes: Official UA
 I 2026 pages list tutorials\, main conference\, workshops\, and paper sub
 mission deadline.\nScope: Learning and reasoning under uncertainty\, cent
 ered on probabilistic and Bayesian modeling\, graphical models\, causal i
 nference\, approximate inference\, and decision theory. Includes Monte Ca
 rlo and variational methods\, uncertainty quantification\, sequential mod
 els\, and principled analysis of learning algorithms. Uncertainty is the 
 organizing theme\, not just another application of general-purpose AI.\nA
 dditional topics: Deep Representation Learning\, Reinforcement Learning\,
  Time Series & Sequential Data\, Explainability & Interpretability\, Robu
 stness & Safety\nScope sources (2026): https://www.auai.org/uai2026/subje
 ct_areas\, https://www.auai.org/uai2026/call_for_papers\nScope last check
 ed: 2026-10-07
